id: demon-mage
name: Demon Mage
order: 2
optionOf: denizen-of-the-demon-realm
optionEffect: 3
description: >
  Reduce the Technique Point Cost of any Magical Unique Abilities by 3 and reduce their Ki Point Cost by 2(T).
text: >
  Demon Mage [Passive]: Reduce the Technique Point Cost of any Magical Unique Abilities by 3 and reduce their Ki Point Cost by 2(T).

---

[passive]
unique.magical.tpCost -= 3;
unique.magical.kiCost -= 2(T);
